    "turn_idx": 89,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, and for me it was never about age. It was really a mindset in just, you know, offering something other than, you know, decades of service in Washington. And that's not to take away the service, you know, of Senators, Senator Biden and Vice President Biden and Senator Sanders. That service certainly is valuable and they would be great presidents. I just think that elections are generally about change. uh... we win when we offer change candidates from kennedy the carter that went into obama and so you know there are change candidates in this race who are you know uh... just as old as senator uh... you know by the standard or at least in that uh... air so i'd i think it's more mindset than age",
